          },
          "spread": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Spread Rate of the Third Party Numeric field (9,6) Max 99.999999 Allow 2 decimals to the left and 6 decimals to the right. Notes: Spread Rate can be included for informational use only. Bank of America spread will be used for financing the invoices."
